Z||000006||theogre||01-30-2001||08:12 PM||||Which automatic is it? there is no limited slip of any kind available for the TH125 or it's reletives that I know of.<P>TH125 and it's relatives will not last if you beat them. You will also need to add additional cooling for the tranny if you are going to even think about this kind of stuff. Tranny Fluid will cook in short order without it. The tranny won't be far behind.<P>You'll also fry the brakes. install a line lock.<p>[This message has been edited by theogre (edited 01-30-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000007||BroCar 87||01-30-2001||08:38 PM||||Thanks theogre, I have added a tranny cooler to my "buy list".<BR>I went to the tranny shop today, and they said there was nothing really I can do to beef up my tranny. Is this true? If I have a lot of power going to my tranny, I don't want to have to replace them from breaking all the time. What options do I have?? Thanks In Advance.<BR>BroCar 87||||reg||1
